# Custom lib API

## Context

Use custom lib in current repo instead of popular external libraries

## Rule

- Use existing API in custom lib from `app/src/lib/text.ts`. Current API contains the following methods: 
    - `slugify(input: string): string`
    - `truncate(input: string, maxLength: number, suffix?: string): string`
    - `normalizeSpaces(input: string): string`
- The API in `app/src/lib/text.ts` does not have the following methods: `capitalize`, `camelCase` etc.
- If you need more utility methods for working with text, add them to `app/src/lib/text.ts` instead of adding a new dependency to the project

## How to verify

- for working with text, existing methods from `app/src/lib/text.ts` are used instead of methods from external libraries
